  "content": {
    "title": "党日活动：全体党员观看人民海军成立70周年阅兵活动",
    "source": "",
    "publishDate": "2019-04-23",
    "bodyHtml": "\n                    <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">2019年4月23日，中共吉林省高校毕业生就业指导中心总支组织全体党员观看在青岛举行的庆祝人民海军成立70周年海上阅兵活动。<spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">23日14时30分许，“西宁”号检阅舰抵达阅兵海域，激越昂扬的《分列式进行曲》响起，海上阅兵正式开始。<spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">中共中央总书记、国家主席、中央军委主席习近平登上检阅台，并下达检阅开始命令。中国人民解放军海军派出32艘舰艇、39架战机，分别编为6个群、10个机队，依次接受检阅。还有俄罗斯、泰国、澳大利亚等13个国家的18艘舰艇，悬挂代满旗，按照作战舰艇、辅助舰船的顺序，按吨位大小从检阅舰前依次驶过。<spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">“同志们好！”统帅的亲切问候，在受阅<spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\">官兵心中激荡。<spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">“主席好！”受阅官兵的铿锵回答，表达了士兵对统帅的赤胆忠诚。<spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">人民海军向前进，胜利航程党指引。进入新时代，人民海军坚定不移加快现代化进程，大踏步赶上时代发展潮流，加速向全面建成世界一流海军迈进，取得了举世瞩目的伟大成就。今天的人民海军，正以全新姿态屹立于世界的东方！中华民族向海图强的世代夙愿正逐步变为现实。<spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">15時30分許，在《友谊地久天长》的乐曲声中，庆祝人民海军成立70周年海上阅兵圆满结束。<spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p><!--[if gte mso 9]><xml><w:LatentStyles DefLockedState=\"false\"  DefUnhideWhenUsed=\"true\"  DefSemiHidden=\"true\"  DefQFormat=\"false\"  DefPriority=\"99\"  LatentStyleCount=\"260\" >\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"Normal\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 1\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Na